{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106256","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106256/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106256/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106256/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106256","id":3054530816,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Vtlib","number":106256,"title":"Fix docgen showing wrong parent class in some situations","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-05-10T21:32:47Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T16:14:57Z","closed_at":"2026-06-14T06:16:39Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106256","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106256","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106256.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106256.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\nThis fixes doc gen sometimes skipping the actual parent of a given class, which affects both XML files exported with `godot --doctool --gdscript-docs` and the in-editor help.\r\n\r\nIf you consider the following inheritance tree: `ClassB < ClassA < RefCounted < Object`, in some circumstances `ClassB` could show `Inherits: RefCounted` instead of `Inherits: ClassA`; conversely, `ClassA` would not show `Inherited by: ClassB`.\r\nThe exact circumstances for this to happen are not entirely clear to me, but I noticed it in at least 2 projects. It appears the issue is caused in part by the order in which scripts are loaded and their respective docs updated.\r\n\r\nWith this PR, both exported XML files and the in-editor help properly display the correct inherited and inheriting classes in both of my affected projects. I just hope this does not somehow break something else.\r\n\r\nFixes #105926 ","closed_by":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106256/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106256/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}